<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and</p>
<p>gilts were steady to $0.50 higher. Demand was moderate. Top</p>
<p>$47.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 46.00-47.50</p>
<p>Sows - mostly steady. Top $47.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 39.00-43.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 42.00-44.00</p>
<p>		500-600 lbs. 44.00-46.00</p>
<p>		few over 600 lbs. 46.00-47.00</p>
</text>
